"┌ Help — tachy 0.1.0 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ Space            show or hide the column                                     │"
"│ J shift-↓        move the column down                                        │"
"│ K shift-↑        move the column up                                          │"
"│ a                show every column                                           │"
"│ /                filter the list by name                                     │"
"│ Column chooser · filtering                                                   │"
"│ Enter            keep the filter                                             │"
"│ Esc              clear the filter                                            │"
"│ ↑ ↓              move the selection                                          │"
"│ other keys       edit the filter                                             │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ Export dialog                                                                │"
"│ Enter            export                                                      │"
"│ Esc              close                                                       │"
"│ Tab              complete the path                                           │"
"│ ↓                select the next item                                        │"
"│ ↑ shift-Tab      select the previous item                                    │"
"│ query:  == != < <= > >=  ~ regex  contains starts ends                       │"
"│ "x"i case-insensitive  in [..]  is [not] null  && || !  and or not           │"
"│ `col name`  $1                                                               │"
"│ goto:  g 50%  = the middle of the file by bytes while indexing,              │"
"│ the middle row once indexed                                                  │"
"└─ k/j scroll  PgUp/PgDn page  Home/G top/bottom  ?/Esc close  113–129 of 129 ─┘"
